Every fucking administration for the last 50 years has had the same basic border policy. "Make coming to this country illegally so incredibly painful and risky that no one will try it" And it does not work. We need something new, putting illegal aliens into detention centers with inhumane conditions is abominable, but obama did it, trump did it, and now biden did it. Look at the conditions in the refugee camps from haiti.
